            "preview": "// value=2 is <= 115, so getCodec returns canonicalCodec[2] = BHSDCodec(1, 256, 1) BHSDCodec resolvedCodec = (BHSDCodec) CodecEncoding.getCodec(2, bandHeaderStream, canonicalCodec13);"
